# 8. Linux Disk and Memory

## `df -h`

Used to check filesystem/disk space.

```bash
df -h
```

## `free -h`

Used to check memory/RAM usage.

```bash
free -h
```

### Memory

```text
df -h
↓
Disk

free -h
↓
RAM
```

This distinction was reinforced because mixing disk space and memory can lead to incorrect troubleshooting decisions.

