# 16. Linux Troubleshooting Scenario

## User Problem

> Linux server is running slowly.

### Investigation

CPU/processes:

```bash
top
```

Memory:

```bash
free -h
```

Disk:

```bash
df -h
```

Processes:

```bash
ps aux
```

Service status:

```bash
systemctl status <service>
```

Service logs:

```bash
journalctl -u <service>
```

### Troubleshooting model

```text
CPU
↓
Memory
↓
Disk
↓
Processes
↓
Services
↓
Logs
```

The technician should investigate before restarting the server.

